---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Study Hub"
  description="How Study Hub handles resource browsing, suggestions, uploads, and third-party services."
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <header class="legal-page-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy and data use</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Study Hub aims to collect only the information needed to provide its learning resources and services.</p>
    </header>
    <article class="legal-copy">
      <p><strong>Owner review required:</strong> this policy describes the current site implementation. Review it for completeness and update it before enabling advertising or adding any new analytics, forms, or tracking services.</p>
      <section>
        <h2>Information you provide</h2>
        <p>Suggestions are submitted without an account. The suggestions database stores the suggestion text, moderation status, and submission time; it does not store a name, email address, user ID, or IP address in that record. Do not include personal or sensitive information in a suggestion.</p>
        <p>Resource contribution forms accept files for review. Submitted files are held in private contribution storage for manual review and are not published automatically. Incomplete upload batches expire after 24 hours. Contact Study Hub if you need help with a contribution.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Browser storage</h2>
        <p>The document reader can save bookmarks and reading color preferences in the current browser. These preferences are not needed to browse the public subject pages and can be cleared using your browser's site-data controls.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Service providers and external content</h2>
        <p>Study Hub uses Supabase to provide resource and contribution services, and Cloudflare Turnstile to help protect forms from automated abuse. Some learning pages link to or embed YouTube videos, and the site loads fonts from Google Fonts. These providers may receive technical information such as your IP address and browser details when your browser connects to their services. Their own privacy policies apply to that processing.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Advertising</h2>
        <p>Google AdSense is not configured in the current site source. If advertising is introduced, this policy and the site's consent controls will be updated to explain the advertising providers, cookies or similar technologies, and available choices before ads go live.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy questions or requests about information you submitted, contact <a href="mailto:trusteth777@gmail.com">Study Hub</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
